Our sg_split candidate v3b (tolerate shape, comparison variant for the v3
cover letter): v2 plus a tolerate fix for bug 4.

Against lib/sg_split.c at v7.1 (same file as the v2 series base 08d0d3466664).
Made from the former vendored tests/irl/linux/sg_split/sg_split_v3b.c; the
sg_split harness Makefile applies it (patch -o) to build that variant.

--- a/lib/sg_split.c
+++ b/lib/sg_split.c
@@ -1,8 +1,22 @@
